ute table says 'go through this shortcut' instead\nof 'go to the internet'.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Gateway Endpoints work by adding a route to your\nroute table. When your EC2 tries to reach S3, the\nroute table says 'go through this shortcut' instead\nof 'go to the internet'.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 18196, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 62082, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "41603885cc06fa15", "type": "text", "x": 2080, "y": 1110, "width": 720, "height": 18, "strokeColor": "#059669", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Key Facts:", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Key Facts:", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 82234, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 12947, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "410d383eca813e3a", "type": "text", "x": 2080, "y": 1132, "width": 720, "height": 18, "strokeColor": "#E2E8F0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 FREE \u2014 no hourly charge, no data processing fee", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 FREE \u2014 no hourly charge, no data processing fee", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 25931, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 77771, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "90c404bc90083dac", "type": "text", "x": 2080, "y": 1150, "width": 720, "height": 18, "strokeColor": "#E2E8F0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 S3 and DynamoDB